  "extension_order": ["J", "B", "T", "P", "C"],
  "extension_gate": "stop_if_E_J_has_no_strict_success_witness",
  "notes": [
    "All candidates retain identical action inventory, effects, goals and evaluator.",
    "E stacks blocker on unrelated distractor; target support stays on table.",
    "No per-trial scene adjustment, evaluator relaxation, model inference or training.",
    "Candidate selection is frozen using H/D before observing E.",
    "Planning rejections remain in coverage denominator; no execution means conditional success is null.",
    "Three related deterministic scenarios are not independent statistical repetitions."
